The Harlequin is one of four devils who have lately grown organized, with [[Divinity/Fiends/Sigzil Haight|the Shackle]], the Hooded and the Loam. Its servants carry the copper-and-sulfur smell of [[Sigzil Haight|Sigzil Haight's]] kind.

The [[Org/The Harlequins/index|Harlequins]] and their [[Org/The Harlequins/People/The Master of Ceremonies|Master of Ceremonies]] are tied to it. The reading of the Master’s burned face and fiendish scent places him with this devil, whether he is it or is sworn to it.

The four are shown as four hands around one eye, the device of [[Divinity/The Eye|the Eye]] that woke them.
